    {
      "source": "The first argument is the name of the collection to run the group operation over, the second is a fluent API that specifies properties of the group operation via a <code>GroupBy</code> class. In this example we are using just the <code>intialDocument</code> and <code>reduceFunction</code> methods. You can also specify a key-function, as well as a finalizer as part of the fluent API. If you have multiple keys to group by, you can pass in a comma separated list of keys.",
      "translation": "第一个参数是执行分组操作的集合名称，第二个参数是一个流式 API，通过 <code>GroupBy</code> 类指定分组操作的属性。在本示例中，我们仅使用了 <code>intialDocument</code> 和 <code>reduceFunction</code> 方法。此外，您还可以通过流式 API 指定键函数以及最终化器。如果需要按多个键进行分组，可以传入逗号分隔的键列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "You can also obtain the raw result as a <code>Document</code> by calling the method <code>getRawResults</code> on the <code>GroupByResults</code> class.",
      "translation": "此外，您可以通过在<code>GroupByResults</code>类上调用<code>getRawResults</code>方法，以<code>Document</code>形式获取原始结果。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "There is an additional method overload of the group method on <code>MongoOperations</code> which lets you specify a <code>Criteria</code> object for selecting a subset of the rows. An example which uses a <code>Criteria</code> object, with some syntax sugar using static imports, as well as referencing a key-function and reduce function javascript files via a Spring Resource string is shown below.",
      "translation": "`MongoOperations` 类中的 `group` 方法还有一个额外的重载版本，允许您指定一个 `Criteria` 对象以选择行的子集。下面展示了一个示例，该示例使用 `Criteria` 对象，并借助静态导入提供了一些语法糖，同时通过 Spring Resource 字符串引用了键函数和 reduce 函数的 JavaScript 文件。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "As an alternative to using Map-Reduce to perform data aggregation, you can use the <a href=\"https://www.mongodb.org/display/DOCS/Aggregation#Aggregation-Group\"><code>group</code> operation</a> which feels similar to using SQL’s group by query style, so it may feel more approachable vs. using Map-Reduce. Using the group operations does have some limitations, for example it is not supported in a shared environment and it returns the full result set in a single BSON object, so the result should be small, less than 10,000 keys.",
      "translation": "作为使用 Map-Reduce 执行数据聚合的替代方案，您可以使用 <a href=\"https://www.mongodb.org/display/DOCS/Aggregation#Aggregation-Group\"><code>group</code> 操作</a>，其感觉类似于 SQL 中的 GROUP BY 查询风格，因此相比使用 Map-Reduce 可能更容易上手。不过，使用 group 操作也存在一些限制：例如，它不支持在共享环境中使用，并且会一次性返回完整的结果集（以单个 BSON 对象形式），因此结果应较小，键的数量少于 10,000 个。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "We would like to group by the only field in each row, the <code>x</code> field and aggregate the number of times each specific value of <code>x</code> occurs. To do this we need to create an initial document that contains our count variable and also a reduce function which will increment it each time it is encountered. The Java code to run the group operation is shown below",
      "translation": "我们希望对每行中的唯一字段 <code>x</code> 进行分组，并聚合每个特定 <code>x</code> 值出现的次数。为此，我们需要创建一个包含计数变量的初始文档，以及一个每次遇到该值时都会对其进行递增的 reduce 函数。执行分组操作的 Java 代码如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring provides integration with MongoDB’s group operation by providing methods on MongoOperations to simplify the creation and running of group operations.\nIt can convert the results of the group operation to a POJO and also integrates with Spring’s <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/resources.html\">Resource abstraction</a> abstraction.\nThis will let you place your JavaScript files on the file system, classpath, http server or any other Spring Resource implementation and then reference the JavaScript resources via an easy URI style syntax, e.g. 'classpath:reduce.js;.\nExternalizing JavaScript code in files if often preferable to embedding them as Java strings in your code.\nNote that you can still pass JavaScript code as Java strings if you prefer.",
      "translation": "Spring 通过为 MongoOperations 提供方法，简化了 MongoDB 聚合操作的创建与执行，从而实现了对该功能的集成。  \n它能够将聚合操作的结果转换为 POJO，并集成了 Spring 的<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/resources.html\">资源抽象</a>机制。  \n这使得您可以将 JavaScript 文件放置在文件系统、类路径、HTTP 服务器或任何其他 Spring 资源实现中，然后通过简单的 URI 风格语法引用这些 JavaScript 资源，例如 'classpath:reduce.js'。  \n将 JavaScript 代码外部化为文件通常比将其作为 Java 字符串嵌入代码中更为可取。  \n请注意，如果您更倾向于这样做，仍然可以将 JavaScript 代码作为 Java 字符串传递。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In order to understand how group operations work the following example is used, which is somewhat artificial. For a more realistic example consult the book 'MongoDB - The definitive guide'. A collection named <code>group_test_collection</code> created with the following rows.",
      "translation": "为了理解分组操作的工作原理，这里使用一个略显人为的例子。若要了解更贴近实际的示例，请参阅《MongoDB——权威指南》一书。创建一个名为<code>group_test_collection</code>的集合，其中包含以下行数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The raw results of the group operation is a JSON document that looks like this",
      "translation": "组操作的原始结果是一个如下所示的 JSON 文档",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The document under the \"retval\" field is mapped onto the third argument in the group method, in this case XObject which is shown below.",
      "translation": "\"retval\" 字段下的文档被映射到组方法的第三个参数，在本例中为 XObject，如下所示。",
      "count": 1
    },
